    "description": {
      "type": "String",
      "label": "Description",
      "value": "<p>The bullet crunches into your face, crumpling part of the maxillary and cheek bones, rearranging the symmetry of your face. Hey, at least your nose is still attached!</p><p><strong>Effects:</strong> Pass an <strong>Average (+20) Endurance</strong> Test or gain @Condition[Unconscious], otherwise gain @Condition[Stunned] (2). You also suffer a -5 penalty to your Fellowship due to the scarring and asymmetry of your new face. </p><p><strong>Surgery (Challenging)</strong> is required for Extraction.</p>"
